@startuml UC2_Create_Profile_Activity_Diagram

title UC2: Create Profile - Activity Diagram

start
:Frontend calls User Actions Server
with Firebase ID token as Bearer token,
after Login / Sign Up (UC1);

:User Actions Server verifies ID token
against Authentication Service
(Firebase Admin SDK);

if (Token valid?) then (no)
  :User Actions Server responds
  as unauthenticated;
  :Frontend returns to
  Login / Sign Up (UC1) form;
  note right: Exception E2 - Token verification fails
  stop
endif

:User Actions Server extracts user_id
(Firebase uid) from the token;

if (User row exists for user_id?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :User Actions Server inserts new
  User row (user_id, created_at);
  note right: idempotent upsert - ON CONFLICT (user_id) DO NOTHING
endif

if (Database write successful?) then (no)
  :User Actions Server displays error
  and allows retry;
  note right: Exception E1 - Database write failure during upsert
  stop
endif

:User Actions Server checks whether user
has at least one CitySite selection;

:User Actions Server responds to Frontend
with the CitySite-selection result;

if (At least one CitySite selection exists?) then (yes)
  :Frontend redirects user to dashboard;
  note right: Alternative Flow A1 - Existing, Already Configured User
else (no)
  partition "Select Cities (UC4)" {
    :User searches for cities via API;
    :Frontend displays matching cities;
    :User selects desired cities;
  }

  partition "Select Forecasting Services (UC5)" {
    :Frontend displays available services;
    :User selects one or more services;
  }
endif

stop

@enduml
